        },
        "c": {
          "device": "cap_cmomf",
          "density_f_per_m2": 0.001287,
          "source": "ihp-sg13cmos5l/libs.tech/klayout/tech/drc/docs/precheck_rules.md (CMOS5L.FORB.MIM: the MIM layer is prohibited, so the densest capacitor is a MOM capacitor); ihp-sg13cmos5l/libs.tech/ngspice/models/cap_cmomf.lib (areacap = 0.372 + (mmax - mmin) x 0.305 fF/um2; Metal1 to Metal4: 1.287 fF/um2; a simulation-derived estimate, not silicon data)"
        }
      }
